{"meta":{"id":"overview","category":"it/server/infra/home-server","title":"개요 · 진행 상황","subtitle":"","summary":"노트북 homeserver 에 Ubuntu Server 26.04 설치 → 고정 IP · HDD → SSH 키 로그인 · 계정 분리 → WireGuard VPN 까지의 구성과 진행 상황","tags":["ubuntu","리눅스","서버","홈서버"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"ubunto_start","updatedAt":"2026-11-01"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>HOME SERVER</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2026-11-01</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">개요 · 진행 상황</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 노트북 homeserver 에 Ubuntu Server 26.04 설치 → 고정 IP · HDD → SSH 키 로그인 · 계정 분리 → WireGuard VPN 까지의 구성과 진행 상황</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">한눈에 보기</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">쓰지 않던 노트북을 집 서버로 쓰기 위해 Ubuntu Server 를 설치하고, 윈도우 PC 와 휴대폰에서 안전하게 접속할 수 있게 SSH 키 로그인과 WireGuard VPN 까지 설정한 과정입니다. 단계별 문서는 같은 폴더에 있습니다.</p><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">항목</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">서버 이름</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>homeserver</code> — 구형 HP EliteBook 노트북</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">OS</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Ubuntu Server 26.04.1 LTS (amd64), UEFI 설치</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">디스크</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">SSD 238 GB → OS (LVM) / HDD 465 GB → <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>/data</code> (ext4, fstab UUID 마운트)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">네트워크</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">유선 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>enp0s25</code>, 공유기 수동 IP 할당으로 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>192.168.0.10</code> 고정</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">계정</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>devuser</code> — SSH 작업용 / <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>adminuser</code> — 관리자(sudo), 집 랜에서만 SSH 허용</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">접속</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">SSH 키 로그인만 허용 (비밀번호 · root 차단), fail2ban. 밖에서는 WireGuard VPN 경유</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">접속 구조</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 space-y-2 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50/70 p-3 sm:p-4 overflow-x-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 min-w-max\"><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">윈도우 PC</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">집 랜 192.168.0.x</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold text-indigo-600 leading-none mb-0.5\">SSH 22</span><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">homeserver</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">192.168.0.10</span></span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 min-w-max\"><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">노트북 · 휴대폰</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">외부망</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold text-indigo-600 leading-none mb-0.5\">UDP 5xxxx</span><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">공유기</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">포트 포워딩</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">wg0</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">10.0.0.1</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold text-indigo-600 leading-none mb-0.5\">SSH</span><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-indigo-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">homeserver</span></span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">외부에는 WireGuard 포트(UDP 5xxxx) 하나만 열고, SSH(22)는 VPN 을 연결한 뒤 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>ssh devuser@10.0.0.1</code> 로 들어갑니다. 관리자 계정 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>adminuser</code> 은 집 랜에서 올 때만 허용해, VPN 키가 새더라도 관리자 권한으로는 바로 들어올 수 없게 했습니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">진행 상황</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">#</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">단계</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">상태</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">1</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Ubuntu Server 설치</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Rufus DD 모드 USB, BIOS UEFI, 루트 볼륨 최대로 늘리기</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">✅ 완료</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">2</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">설치 후 설정</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">고정 IP, 덮개 닫아도 동작, HDD <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>/data</code> 마운트</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">✅ 완료</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">3</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">기본 도구</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">vim · htop · tmux · git · fail2ban 등 설치와 최소 사용법</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">✅ 완료</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">4</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">OpenSSH</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">키 로그인, 계정 분리, 비밀번호 로그인 차단, fail2ban</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">✅ 완료</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">5</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">WireGuard VPN</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">서버 · 윈도우 · 휴대폰 설정, 포트 포워딩, 연결 확인</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">🔄 집 안 확인 완료, 외부망 확인 남음</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">기록 규칙</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">• 단계마다 왜 그렇게 했는지와 확인 명령 · 결과를 같이 적는다.<br>• 비밀번호, 개인 키 같은 민감 정보는 적지 않는다.<br>• 계정 이름, 서버 이름, IP, VPN 포트 번호는 실제 값 대신 예시 값(<code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>devuser</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>192.168.0.10</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>5xxxx</code> 등)으로 적는다.</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/server/infra/home-server/overview","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"server","title":"서버","path":"it/server"},{"id":"infra","title":"인프라","path":"it/server/infra"},{"id":"home-server","title":"홈 서버 (Ubuntu)","path":"it/server/infra/home-server"}],"hasImage":false}